<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1370_4773.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/>Herr <persName role="recipient" resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Wachter</unclear></persName> ich kan nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">underlaßen</unclear>. euch ein klein
<lb n="2"/>wenig <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brichten</unclear>. daß ir euch nit in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eüwer</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bruß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hren</unclear>
<lb n="3"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">nin</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schäment</unclear>. daß ir noch etwas <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">rest</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hand</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heischen</unclear>. und
<lb n="4"/>ich selbs. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oeffter</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mal</unclear>. in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">euwer</unclear> hauß selbst gangen bin
<lb n="5"/>und euch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsagt</unclear>. ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">im</unclear> den alten wein nit <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">allein</unclear> geben
<lb n="6"/>und ir hand wol <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gwüßt</unclear>. daß er den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">neuwen</unclear> wein
<lb n="7"/>nit kan verbrauchen. wann er ist <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erst</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geltß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wil</unclear>
<lb n="8"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">recht</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gsin</unclear>, wie ir mir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kosten</unclear> geben haben.
<lb n="9"/>ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">heischendt</unclear> 10. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">krl</unclear> für den alten wein. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wir</unclear> hand
<lb n="10"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">beßeren</unclear> umb 8. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">krl</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kan</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">pfauch</unclear> der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">schamen</unclear>. als ein
<lb n="11"/>solcher mann. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">darffst</unclear> alß mit den leüten <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umbgohn</unclear>.
<lb n="12"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wier</unclear> hand den wein selben umb 10. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">krl</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wegggeben</unclear>.
<lb n="13"/>ir sollend <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wüßen</unclear>. daß ich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">gestragß</unclear> will zum
<lb n="14"/>Burgermeister <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kehren</unclear>. wann er <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ein</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heller</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">verspricht</unclear>
<lb n="15"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuegeben</unclear>. on deß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermeisterß</unclear> befelch und rath
<lb n="16"/>ir hand <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermeint</unclear>. daß in der <placeName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Züllig</unclear></placeName>. allß umb
<lb n="17"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">roß</unclear> in schaden bracht hat. daß er <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">meinen</unclear> herren
<lb n="18"/>schuldig ist und anderen ehrlichen leüten. so hand ir
<lb n="19"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">vermeint</unclear> es gelte gleich. wie ir mit der sach
<lb n="20"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">umbgehend</unclear>. aber nit alß. es <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">heist</unclear> handlen. daß
<lb n="21"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">mannß</unclear> vor Gott könn verantworten wann du
<lb n="22"/>schon der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ander</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">Burgermaister</unclear> bist du
<lb n="23"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">must</unclear> es <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dennocht</unclear> vor Gott verantworten. wann
<lb n="24"/>du schon hie <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">menst</unclear> du wellest <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">etwaß</unclear> außrichten
<lb n="25"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">X</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oder</unclear> <persName resp="#ner"><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Cunrad</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Schneider</unclear></persName> ach daß Gott <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">klagt</unclear> sy. über den <placeName resp="#ner">Züllig</placeName>, daß er
<lb n="26"/>mich und meine kinder. allß in sein hauß gezwungen.
<lb n="27"/>und all wochen 2 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">fl</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zinß</unclear> genomen. daß mir <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">dach</unclear>
<lb n="28"/>hand <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mießen</unclear> gehn. aber <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">roß</unclear> auß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ander</unclear> leüten
<lb n="29"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">staehel</unclear>. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">handß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">unß</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">mießen</unclear> geben. aber es hat
<lb n="30"/>in nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">drab</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gchoßen</unclear>. Gott geb <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wie</unclear> ich mit
<lb n="31"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">schreijen</unclear> und klagen bin <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> im komen. sein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">frau</unclear>
<lb n="32"/>hat sich nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">geschämet</unclear>. dem <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">weber</unclear> lohn ab dem
<lb n="33"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">offen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zue</unclear> nemen. und daß brodt umb 6 <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">kr</unclear>. auß
<lb n="34"/>dem hauß <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zuetragen</unclear> ich <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">globen</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ietz</unclear> daß ich <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">ietz</unclear>
<lb n="35"/>glauben gebe. <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">waß</unclear> der baur gesagt hat. ich
<lb n="36"/>wunsch dir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">glueck</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">uff</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dieben</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zunfft</unclear>. aber den
<lb n="37"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">bauren</unclear> hat mann <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gestrafft</unclear> aber <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vmb</unclear> den <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">kleinen</unclear>
<lb n="38"/>gilt es gleich. <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wannß</unclear> nit <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gnug</unclear> am <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">brieff</unclear> ist
<lb n="39"/>so wil ich euch <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">antwort</unclear> geben <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">wo</unclear> ir <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">wend</unclear>.
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1370_4774.jpg" n="2"/>
</p>
